1. Mission & Promise

You will own a resilient, privacy‑first smart home that works even when your internet connection fails. The system is built around one local hub and four modular subsystems.

Module What it does
Light Turn on/off automatically by schedule, sunset, or motion
Temperature Monitor room temperature & humidity; receive an alert if thresholds are breached
Security Know immediately when a door or window opens — notifications stay inside your network
Energy See real‑time power consumption and daily electricity cost

What your finished home will do:

· Control lights based on time, sunlight, or presence
· Send a notification to your phone when the front door opens after dark
· Alert you if a room exceeds 26 °C
· Show you exactly how much energy your TV or office is using — and what it costs
· Keep every automation running even when your broadband is down

What this system is not:

· It does not require a monthly subscription or a cloud account.
· It does not send your data outside your home.
· It does not need an engineer to set up — if you can follow a recipe, you can build this.

