7. Automated Backups — Protect Everything

Data loss from a failed disk or corrupted update can wipe out your entire configuration.

Setup — 3 minutes:

1. Settings → System → Backups.
2. Click “Set up automatic backups”.
3. Schedule: Daily at 04:45 AM. Retention: keep the last 7.
4. Enable encryption and download the emergency kit file immediately — email it to yourself or print it.
5. (Optional) Add remote storage: Google Drive, NAS, or Home Assistant Cloud.

Recovery: Flash a fresh HA OS image, choose “Restore from backup”, upload your encrypted file, enter the decryption key. Everything is back — automations, dashboards, energy history.

